    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen005.png",
    "sha256": "2e14e4ee48c39dde6ff8afeff8e4cd0fdd7d7865be715cc921f1b5e499a6cbc8",
    "k": 4,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Is the phenomenon of parent and kids studying together at university a rare case?",
    "zh": "父母和孩子一起上大学，这种现象少见吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "phenomenon"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen006.png",
    "sha256": "798f38c094ea6bccd5fb1191b35df20a5f53c91c6915c06fe4e01a64c40c0a89",
    "k": 5,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I am afraid not.",
    "zh": "恐怕并不少见。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "i am afraid not"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen007.png",
    "sha256": "3ce872882da784545ce99b9f40a542185dff38a33508d9d3282c88ca06bb0def",
    "k": 6,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Changing careers later in life is no longer a rarity, so it is not uncommon for students and their parents to be toying with the big decisions at the same time.",
    "zh": "在人生后期转行已经不是什么稀罕事了，因此，学生和父母同时考虑重大决定也并不少见。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "toy with"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen008.png",
    "sha256": "be42f1a4c3c9b5e4e3aa68c955593a230dbf3a107d93fd27123280126473dbdd",
    "k": 7,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Class surveys indicate that the majority of Harvard alumni have shifted directions when it comes to their careers.",
    "zh": "班级调查显示，大多数哈佛校友在职业发展中都曾改变方向。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "alumnus"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen009.png",
    "sha256": "e45e38508eb584190d24cc2a1b47791f49df8c3c752469e07cfb112a9d0bb5a7",
    "k": 8,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "With the financial collapse of 2008, such shifts have become more widespread.",
    "zh": "2008年金融危机之后，这种转变变得更加普遍。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "collapse"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen010.png",
    "sha256": "382f7ef30368ce6ca12d1acaeaadd52da7dd04d28f73409f954ec097717ebd54",
    "k": 9,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Students have seen their family members lose jobs or change them.",
    "zh": "学生们见过家人失业或转行。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "lose jobs"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen011.png",
    "sha256": "3d38d7e59bacd99de5b5662ecdc9be62487eee312dfc955632e7ca7cc882e04c",
    "k": 10,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Gone is the time when you start out at a company and work there for the rest of your life.",
    "zh": "从进入一家公司起就在那儿工作一辈子的时代，已经过去了。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "start out"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "75b77bc886773d0500d8fa1433fd04bfb4e3aec03c2e7a2e4546070dc6f73df9",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So your mom started study again just because she wanted to change her career?",
    "zh": "所以，你妈妈重新开始学习，就是因为她想转行吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "career"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "bd6276a0e09e785a0ecf8f6f2d5b032ad7654496ec4cf3db42f583cb81d37d0a",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes, she used to be in the real estate industry but now she wants to be a lawyer.",
    "zh": "是的，她以前从事房地产行业，现在则想成为一名律师。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "real estate"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "eae60e9043f97cbe44a664253eacbe5374afe42d3232db5fe705511637bdc0b3",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Does her experience affect you somewhat?",
    "zh": "她的经历会对你产生一些影响吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "affect"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "ba4be708dc1177d80eb014289a0de0b8a28546c3e551a80f04fadd5839b898dc",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Certainly.",
    "zh": "当然。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "certainly"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "3d08d42c81b09891f1af21bd9d15ca4af48f939b1b3aa2aae1b5e7d74c32a498",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Freshman Week, in one of the welcoming speeches, ",
    "zh": "新生周的一次欢迎致辞中，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "freshman"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "1867f3b44334431c7fa2ce4a0e7a49eb6ce8e9fc5e63301a92530bd78b872f34",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "our dean mentioned that many of us might have grown up thinking that “doctor, lawyer, teacher” were our only options.",
    "zh": "院长提到，我们很多人可能从小就认为“医生、律师、教师”是仅有的职业选择。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "dean"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "33ac3dcce8e8a07bab3c9202645db344c52850da787123764fe8f58e126b1545",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "She urged us to stick to our dreams.",
    "zh": "她鼓励我们坚持自己的梦想。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "stick to"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "b6275276d34df80975784718fefc33d56400b46aec1f1b1254d68194e45514cd",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But later I realized talking about passions is one thing—actually following them is another.",
    "zh": "但后来我意识到，谈论热爱的事情是一回事，真正去追随它们则是另一回事。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "passion"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "ea95af2b18d9cd767483057a0cff8d688764ef9baf12fd776a59516724a1079d",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "By the time I started to think about what professional directions I might want to take, ",
    "zh": "当我开始思考自己可能会选择怎样的职业方向时，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "professional"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "c17bbe457f9ca8405288341ed4ef91ba50c451ad2dc63599b97173e0240e9297",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I had heard “The average American changes careers seven times” so often that it was hard not to become numb to its message.",
    "zh": "“美国人平均一生会转行七次”这句话我已经听得太多，几乎对此麻木了。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "numb"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "11f300c84ec82d29c822258f9b0d46c834063457888785131527d37d47722b24",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The last thing that the enthusiastic Harvard student wants to do is to imagine moving from job to job until she lands somewhere by chance, ",
    "zh": "一个满怀热情的哈佛学生，最不愿意想象的，就是自己在不同工作间辗转，直到碰巧落在某个岗位上，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "by chance"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "82ed69f40389914e9b267b70166cfed42c854a2e80ef36d1b4481a09cf8e3306",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "especially when the economy is so uncertain.",
    "zh": "尤其是经济如此不确定的时候。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "uncertain"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "933bce75f9f1307e07b7a8552653b9c3e5450543341240c8206d7cea9ce18727",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "My mom can serve as a good example.",
    "zh": "我妈妈就是一个很好的例子。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "serve as"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "a3216ce9dc51af5cdd20bfa196a14caed83d58acf9398149e190872426197250",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Even if she graduated from Harvard herself as a brilliant student, she had to make alterations of her career.",
    "zh": "即使她当初也是以优异成绩从哈佛毕业，也仍然不得不调整自己的职业方向。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "alteration"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "4a7025926d58f55606ee740691f66208843fa6b3dc82e3c14d6e53ddce9d83c2",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, is your mom actually happy studying with younger students?",
    "zh": "那么，你妈妈和年轻学生一起上课，真的开心吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "actually"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "f8a2e8b5dc028708c1848442733b85a3d47f8495db0b1f64148489134394193c",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Hard to say.",
    "zh": "很难说。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hard to say"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "220d8431bb8138dbbde5e0614c0fee6811b1a43317db17c66bc131d09cfa508c",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Frustration is routine for older students, you know, who have to learn how to study all over again.",
    "zh": "对年长的学生来说，挫败感是家常便饭，因为他们得重新学会如何学习。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "routine"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "707cd6fd2861cd8d5c86a70b3449c296b96d14ccabfc825dae31943200b40502",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Mom once described the experience of taking classes with students half her age after 30 years in the workforce: ",
    "zh": "妈妈曾这样描述自己工作三十年后，和年龄只有自己一半的学生一起上课的经历：",
    "vocabulary": [
      "workforce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "4265ea73efbe3fe1e7395bfb9ba24119e3e4e550723a7ddbd38e8e0e599bc5dc",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "“What’s most challenging is that you come into class knowing how to make a cake—but you’re all there to make omelets.”",
    "zh": "“最有挑战的是，你走进教室时已经知道怎样做蛋糕了，但大家在这里学的却是做煎蛋卷。”",
    "vocabulary": [
      "omelet"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "77acf5a4d4dd5b4456224d5fd657bd04e6c2c187397974c301ce259be3eb849c",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "A kind of wasting time?",
    "zh": "有种在浪费时间的感觉？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "wasting time"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "5c3728ada5fe5961b4e0b4103138240394692a5d3a6f66dcc5e3236ec545b61b",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Exactly.",
    "zh": "正是如此。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "exactly"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "5278b128a35b6840753074591c97b2ccd97e73655f2dc26e1572f8c2d4ca7212",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Do you think your mom has played an important role in shaping your idea of what kind of person you want to be?",
    "zh": "你觉得，在形成自己想成为什么样的人的观念时，妈妈发挥过重要作用吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "shape"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "d83a80eb634eff54437350291cbba5534c1e03b040c55cd9ad7ac0c6e34623b2",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Absolutely.",
    "zh": "绝对是这样。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "absolutely"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "57fdf3385c526d3fb23ffbda8b62b5ef415efc135285978ad3ec857b75d696e6",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Harvard offers many resources for students who want to figure out where their future lies.",
    "zh": "哈佛为想弄清未来方向的学生提供了许多资源。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "figure out"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "367f2359492b2b0df56055a704ca933537ec4630df1b2d63cd0933ec9b3d6074",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Advisers, tutors, and OCS keep their doors open to help undergraduates embark on this kind of discovery.",
    "zh": "学业导师、辅导老师和职业服务办公室都敞开大门，帮助本科生开始这样的探索。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "embark on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "827e9aa32e9759037535507d53c64842023a8d3373a4279728a0ef80296a7251",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "One can’t find one’s passions in a booklet on summer internships or a list of possible career paths.",
    "zh": "一个人无法仅凭一本暑期实习手册，或一张可能的职业道路清单，就找到自己的热爱。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "booklet"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "980e89afcbf2905605f622a85dce12469da63890e8d25ea7d8563d52f6fd7055",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It’s a gradual process that involves sharing thoughts and then coming back to them; a discussion that doesn’t always have its end goal in mind.",
    "zh": "这是一个循序渐进的过程，需要交流想法，再回过头来思考；这样的讨论并不总是一开始就有明确的终点。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "gradual"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "4021207665283c556aea80a559e0cd7d991cf042d7b430e04e55b230c7c34440",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "In the course of my time at Harvard, it has been just such a give-and-take—with professors, with friends, and with my mother—",
    "zh": "在哈佛求学期间，正是和教授、朋友、妈妈之间这样的思想交流，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "give-and-take"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "6909e08a4c7684bec9963527481cb42eb3eaaea6e8e2b4596887349a9fa801da",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "that has slowly shaped my ideas of who I might want to be.",
    "zh": "慢慢塑造了我对未来想成为怎样的人的认识。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "shape"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "2819a56b2ddf795fd9a6bee8655edf31fbaaa0daa6bf699e5bf74bf7c7f1b93b",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I really cherish the time she spent together with me at university.",
    "zh": "我非常珍惜她和我一起在大学度过的时光。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "cherish"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "ec76e91e66e279405ee7fd80fa9f9d3a04f56f0c31042b4efdd096ca341a4b28",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, Maggie.",
    "zh": "好的，玛吉。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "well"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
